  <p class="gd-lede">Few experiences bond a group like heli-skiing together: a private helicopter, an empty mountain, and a shared adventure no one forgets. Whether it is a group of friends, a family celebration or a corporate incentive trip, a private or buyout booking gives you the operation to yourselves. This is how private group and corporate heli-skiing works in Iceland, and how to organise it, before you look at <a href="/packages">the packages</a>.</p>
